    "imageAlt": "Farkur, a compact grey-furred pirate and builder with a white beard, black tricorn hat, armored coat, and several pistols",
    "imageCaption": "Farkur S. Gemblenagin — founder, builder, and institutional architect of the Ale-Chemy Knights.",
    "video": "farkur-portrait.mp4",
